# CogniLink Assistant Project Structure

This is an Obsidian plugin for AI-enhanced knowledge management. The project follows a standard React + TypeScript structure.

## Core Files
- [src/main.ts](mdc:src/main.ts) - Main plugin entry point
- [manifest.json](mdc:manifest.json) - Plugin manifest
- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Project configuration and dependencies
- [esbuild.config.mjs](mdc:esbuild.config.mjs) - Build configuration

## Key Directories
- `src/components/` - React components
  - [src/components/ChatView.tsx](mdc:src/components/ChatView.tsx) - Main chat view container
  - [src/components/Chat.tsx](mdc:src/components/Chat.tsx) - Chat interface component
- `src/services/` - Business logic
  - [src/services/AIService.ts](mdc:src/services/AIService.ts) - AI integration service
  - [src/services/EmbeddingService.ts](mdc:src/services/EmbeddingService.ts) - Embedding and semantic search
- `src/types/` - TypeScript type definitions
  - [src/types/settings.ts](mdc:src/types/settings.ts) - Settings interface
  - [src/types/chat.ts](mdc:src/types/chat.ts) - Chat-related types
- `src/constants/` - Constants and defaults
  - [src/constants/settings.ts](mdc:src/constants/settings.ts) - Default settings

## Configuration Files
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration
- [.eslintrc](mdc:.eslintrc) - ESLint rules
- [.prettierrc](mdc:.prettierrc) - Code formatting rules
- [styles.css](mdc:styles.css) - Global styles
